<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ENGLAND 137-9 V ZIMBABWE - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 137-9 V ZIMBABWE - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 137-9 when bad light ended play early on the first day of the second test against Zimbabwe at Harare Sports Club on Thursday.</p>
